  "question": {
    "text": "If $(\\mathrm{p} \\wedge \\sim \\mathrm{q}) \\wedge(\\mathrm{p} \\wedge \\mathrm{r}) \\rightarrow \\sim p \\vee q$ is false, then the truth values of $\\mathrm{p}, \\mathrm{q}$ and $\\mathrm{r}$ are respectively",
