  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As the truth table for the $(p \\wedge \\sim q) \\wedge(p \\wedge r)$ $\\rightarrow \\sim p \\vee q$ is false, then only possible values of $(p, q, r)$ is $(T, F, T)$\n$\\begin{array}{llllll}p & q & r & \\sim q & p \\wedge \\sim q & p \\wedge r \\\\ \\sim p & \\sim p \\vee q & (p \\wedge \\sim q) \\wedge(p \\wedge r)(p \\wedge \\sim q) \\wedge(p \\wedge r) \\\\ \\rightarrow \\sim p \\vee q\\end{array}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/oaYv7WZEGTGzOfZsUc1Df8pk6nzdfvgi7W66eTy1CZs.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
